    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4106628,
        4106678
      ],
      "value": "## 可压缩上下文（只编译这一部分）",
      "index": 36
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4106678,
        4106908
      ],
      "value": "You are a writing-context compressor. Compress the input into a writing context package of no more than 2500 words, keeping the facts, conflicts, hooks, and constraints most critical for writing chapter N. Use Markdown sections.",
      "index": 37
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4106908,
        4107097
      ],
      "value": "你是写作上下文压缩器。将输入压缩为不超过 2500 字的写作上下文包，保留对写第 N 章最关键的事实、冲突、伏笔与约束。使用 Markdown 小节。",
